      "chunk_id": "694eee0a-a7d9-4774-ae63-4310526fb179",
      "content": "Incident Triage\n\nSecurity incidents are triaged by impact, affected systems, data classification, and containment status. The exact severity scoring formula is not published in this knowledge base.\n\nIT/Admin users should record incident timeline, containment steps, affected data categories, and communication owner.",
